<title>BOTSWANA: BOTSWANA STOCKS WEEK - SLOW START TO NEW YEAR.</title>
<headline>BOTSWANA STOCKS WEEK - SLOW START TO NEW YEAR.</headline>
<dateline>GABORONE 1997-01-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trade on the Botswana Stock</p>
<p>Exchange was well down during the first full week of 1997. All</p>
<p>stocks traded, but on small volumes.</p>
<p>The only gainer was Barclays, which put on five thebe to</p>
<p>close at 465 thebe.</p>
<p>Volume traded over the week was 20,876 (42,100), value</p>
<p>53,128 pula (122,585 pula). The index fell 2.15 points to close</p>
<p>at 350.03 points. -- Gaborone newsroom +267 347182</p>
</text>
